---

<BaseLayout
  title="Moving Blog | Tips, Advice & Guides | Legacy Moving Denver"
  description="Expert moving advice, tips, and guides from Legacy Moving Denver. Learn about moving to Colorado, packing tips, and professional moving services."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-secondary/90 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay">
      <Image 
        src={heroImage} 
        alt="Legacy Moving Denver Blog" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="container relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-6">Moving Blog</h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Expert moving advice, tips, and guides from Denver's trusted moving professionals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Blog Posts Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

          <!-- Blog Post: Renters Moving Out of Apartments — August 19 2026 -->
          <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
            <div class="h-48 relative overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={storageImage}
                alt="What renters should know before moving out of apartments in Denver Colorado"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/50 to-secondary/60"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1"><Calendar size={16} /><span>Aug 19, 2026</span></div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1"><Clock size={16} /><span>9 min read</span></div>
              </div>
              <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-secondary mb-3 line-clamp-2">What Renters Should Know Before Moving Out of an Apartment in Denver Colorado</h2>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 line-clamp-3">Security deposit strategies, cleaning standards, move-out inspections, lease termination timelines, and avoiding hidden fees when moving out of Denver apartments.</p>
              <a href="/blog/what-renters-should-know-moving-out-apartment-denver" class={buttonVariants({ variant: 'default', className: 'w-full' })}>
                Read More <ArrowRight size={16} className="ml-2" />
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Blog Post: Utilities and Address Changes — August 15 2026 -->
